  "description": "As with all Mercian bikes, the frame is tailor-made to the rider's dimensions, built in Derby using the finest Reynolds lightweight steel tubing. Fitted with a 250W Mahle hub motor, the rear wheel slots into specific Reynolds dropouts (which house the Mahle drive connector unit and motion sensor) and is secured with a 12mm thru-axle. The Speed sensor ensures the bike complies with regulations and effortlessly accelerates you up to 25km/h. With the Mahle XS battery providing you with 171Wh of power and a range of 60km, the long and winding road just got easier. The battery can be easily removed for on-the-go charging with the handy Energy Hub.\n\nBeing a small and lightweight battery, the total weight of the eVentura is kept low at 13.3kg, making it manageable for lifting into your car, apartment or boat.\n\nRange : 60kms (ranges are quoted by battery manufacturer (Mahle) based off rider with an average height & weight, cycling a combination of flat and hilly terrain.)",
